; PT22 (#943): five ELLIPSE records from the AutoCAD 2021 Properties palette session.
; Source and session log: Matleyx78/dxf-test-file at d5fe8e419b90d0c2bf32e0ce652c03c0c7dfd3f9 (CC0-1.0).
; ezdxf supplies centers, axes, ratios and DXF parameters. True angles come from the
; session log and the inverse conversion atan2(b*sin(t), a*cos(t)). Areas follow
; PT22: pi*a*b for a full ellipse and a*b/2*(sweep - sin(sweep)) for a segment.
D = DXF source=autocad-proprieta
? units D -> 4
; A4: major radius 20 to 30, minor radius still 10.
? entity D A4 -> ELLIPSE center=60,-40 major-axis=30,0 ratio=0.3333333333333333
? properties D A4 -> center=60,-40; major-radius=30; minor-radius=10; ratio=0.3333333333333333; start-angle=0; end-angle=360; ~area=1884.955592153876
; A5: minor radius 10 to 5, major radius still 20.
? entity D A5 -> ELLIPSE center=110,-40 major-axis=20,0 ratio=0.25
? properties D A5 -> center=110,-40; major-radius=20; minor-radius=5; ratio=0.25; start-angle=0; end-angle=360; ~area=314.1592653589793
; A6: AutoCAD refused major radius 5. The ellipse case covers Tecnigrafo's axis swap.
? entity D A6 -> ELLIPSE center=160,-40 major-axis=20,0 ratio=0.5
? properties D A6 -> center=160,-40; major-radius=20; minor-radius=10; ratio=0.5; start-angle=0; end-angle=360; ~area=628.3185307179587
; A7: true angles 45 and 135.
? entity D A7 -> ELLIPSE center=210,-40 major-axis=20,0 ratio=0.5 start=63.43494882292198 end=116.56505117707795
? properties D A7 -> center=210,-40; major-radius=20; minor-radius=10; ratio=0.5; start-angle=45; end-angle=135; ~area=12.7295218001612
; A8: true start angle changed from 45 to 30.
? entity D A8 -> ELLIPSE center=260,-40 major-axis=20,0 ratio=0.5 start=49.1066053508691 end=116.56505117707795
? properties D A8 -> center=260,-40; major-radius=20; minor-radius=10; ratio=0.5; start-angle=30; end-angle=135; ~area=25.3770242285045
